0. VERIFY F_H AGAINST AUTODIFF ON THE REPO'S SQUASHED LOG-PROB
==============================================================================
  L_H = alpha * E[log pi(a|s)] with a = tanh(y); F := -dL/dlog_sigma
  closed form  F_H = alpha * [1 - 2 sigma^2 E(sech^2 y)]

    mu   sigma |   -autodiff        F_H        |err|
  -1.00   0.20 |   +0.965702   +0.965488  2.13e-04
