   0.70   0.50 |   +0.690561   +0.690862  3.01e-04
   0.70   1.50 |   -0.900432   -0.903539  3.11e-03

  AUTODIFF_MATCH max abs error = 8.986e-03  (alpha factored out; Stein form,
  so this is MC convergence, not a discrepancy)
  convergence at mu=0, sigma=1.5:
